{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063461/block/singleImage/3265524/df/01M77GDK6S3KMJVB5NHX1DZ3MX.jpg?updatedAt=1794474855\"/><figcaption>青衣發生涉及警察電單車交通意外。（fb「馬路的事討論區」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>青衣發生涉及警察電單車交通意外。 今日（12日）下午2時許，一輛警察電單車在青衣西北交匯處、近青嶼幹線觀景台對開，與一輛綠頂專線小巴相撞。警察電單車翻側橫亙在路中。車禍中無人受傷。警方正在調查車禍起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:43:59.185391+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:14:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:16.635277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:37:17.081964+00:00","content_hash":"bf3d2bd8e682c43d6a8c41c21091bcce5f9d882473cb572795e184e6b72c2e9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:43:59.185391+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}